Z||000015||aka||08-14-2001||11:24 PM||||Dude!   I just did the same exact trip as you did a month ago!   I did see some Fieros, I stopped in Reno for 2 days and saw more Fieros there than the whole trip.  The only down side is I didn't want to mile out my 86GT so I took my Neon...  Yes I have a Neon for a commuter car but drive the Fiero for fun.  I just moved to Strathmore from north of Edmonton, I was part of the Edmonton fiero club, now I have to join up with the Calgary Fiero club.   anyways, later!<P>------------------<BR>86 GT 4speed<BR>85 SC 5speed||||reg||1
